sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Browser user
  participant B as Browser agent
  participant P as Public page
  participant J as Static JSON/OKF
  U->>P: Open accessible site
  P->>B: Register safe read-only tools
  B->>P: Search/apply facet/inspect
  P->>J: Read packaged public data
  J-->>P: Records and provenance
  P-->>B: Structured result
  P-->>U: Visible equivalent state
  Note over P,J: No protected credentials or operations
